{"decisions":[{"answer":null,"default":"one_per_order","id":"stacking","options":["one_per_order","stack_all"],"question":"一张订单能用几张券？"},{"answer":null,"default":"full_refund_only","id":"refund","options":["full_refund_only","prorated"],"question":"退款时已享折扣怎么处理？"},{"answer":null,"default":"end_of_day","id":"expiry_boundary","options":["end_of_day","start_of_day"],"question":"过期日当天还能用吗？"},{"answer":null,"default":"1","id":"per_user_limit","options":["1","3","unlimited"],"question":"每个用户能用同一张券几次？"},{"answer":null,"default":"error_keep_coupon","id":"below_threshold","options":["error_keep_coupon","error_consume","silent_zero"],"question":"订单金额低于门槛时怎么办？"},{"answer":null,"default":"none","id":"percent_cap","options":["none","fixed_cents"],"question":"百分比券有封顶吗？"}],"intent":"订单优惠券模块。支持百分比券和固定金额券。每张券有使用门槛、过期日和每用户次数限制。折扣必须逐项可核对：百分比部分和固定部分分开记账，总额等于分项之和。金额一律用整数分。","module":"coupon","properties":[{"evidence":"scenario","id":"total_bounds","text":"折扣总额恒在 [0, 订单小计] 内，固定券面额大于小计时按小计封顶"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"line_items","text":"折扣分项逐项正确：百分比券只有百分比部分，固定券只有固定部分，总额等于分项之和。只对总额的检查不算数"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"threshold_error","text":"低于门槛返回错误状态，且不消耗券（error_keep_coupon）"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"stacking","text":"订单已用过券时第二张被拒（one_per_order）"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"expiry_boundary","text":"过期日当天可用，次日不可用（end_of_day）"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"user_limit","text":"同一用户第二次使用被拒，其他用户不受影响（上限 1 次）"},{"evidence":"scenario","id":"percent_cap","text":"无封顶时百分比折扣按比例算；给定封顶时不超过封顶"},{"evidence":"verify","fn":"percent_discount","id":"percent_discount_bounds","text":"percent_discount 对定义域内所有输入满足 0 <= result <= subtotal"}],"source":"coupon.ax"}